   (Points drawer / Rewards drawer / Membership drawer — ALL the same)
   - ClearOmni card and the gold gradient card are REMOVED.
   - Tier card shows the tier icon image fetched from the BON Loyalty
     backend; a built-in medal icon is used until BON data is available.
   ======================================================================== */
.fsb-tier-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #eceae6;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;box-sizing:border-box}
